## 3. Implementation Milestones

### Milestone A: Theme & Styling Setup
- [ ] Create `ColorsManager` class in `lib/constants/` with colors extracted from mockups
- [ ] Create `TextStyles` class in `lib/constants/` using `.sp` sizing
- [ ] Update `AppTheme` in `lib/constants/app_theme.dart` to use new tokens
- [ ] **Acceptance**: App builds, existing screens render with new colors, no visual regressions

### Milestone B: Auth Screens (Login/Register)
- [ ] Restyle `LoginScreen` (`lib/Auth_screens/loginpage.dart`) to match `UI/login screen/screen.png`
- [ ] Restyle `RegisterScreen` (`lib/Auth_screens/registerScreen.dart`) to match mockup style
- [ ] Extract reusable form widgets to `lib/widgets/`
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match to mockups, login/register flows work, validation errors display correctly

### Milestone C: Home Screen
- [ ] Create new `NotesView` replacement in `lib/page/` matching `UI/homeScreen/home screen.png`
- [ ] Integrate `NoteRepository.allNotes` stream
- [ ] Implement empty state, loading state, error state
- [ ] Add FAB navigation to `createOrUpdateNoteRoute`
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, notes list renders, pull-to-refresh triggers sync, offline shows cached notes

### Milestone D: Note Editor Restyling
- [ ] Update `CreateUpdateNoteView` (`lib/page/create_update_note_view.dart`) styling to match `UI/notely_editor/edit_screen.png`
- [ ] Keep FlutterQuill as editor engine
- [ ] Restyle toolbar in `lib/widgets/note_toolbar.dart`
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, all formatting options work, auto-save persists, share functions

### Milestone E: Favourites Screen + DB Migration
- [ ] Run DB migration (see Section 2)
- [ ] Add `toggleFavorite(id)` and `getFavorites()` to `NoteRepository`
- [ ] Create Favourites screen matching `UI/Favourite screen/favourite.png`
- [ ] Add star/favorite toggle icon to note cards
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Toggle persists to sqflite, syncs to Firestore, filtered list shows only favorites

### Milestone F: Settings & Account Screens
- [ ] Restyle Settings screen (`lib/page/setting_screen.dart`) to match `UI/setting screen/settings.png`
- [ ] Ensure theme toggle persists via `shared_preferences`
- [ ] Create Account screen matching `UI/account_screen/account.png` (display user email, logout)
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Theme toggle works and persists, logout triggers AuthBloc event, account info displays

### Milestone G: Search Screen
- [ ] Create dedicated Search screen or enhance inline search on home
- [ ] Match `UI/search_screen/search.png` design
- [ ] Implement debounced search filtering via `NoteRepository`
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Visual match, results filter in <300ms, "no results" empty state shows

